---
description: maro.al UI must follow the canonical maro-design-system package
globs: src/**/*.{ts,tsx,css}
alwaysApply: true
---

Before changing UI, read `maro-design-system/MARO-DESIGN-SYSTEM.md` and `maro-design-system/tokens/maro.css`.

- Import order: Manrope → `tokens/maro.css` → `maro-primitives.css` → `src/styles/maro-compat.css` (wired in `globals.css`).
- Use semantic `--maro-*` tokens; never hardcode brand hex in components.
- Figma tracking -30 = `letter-spacing: -0.03em` (`--maro-tracking-brand`).
- Reuse official SVGs from `maro-design-system/` (sync via `pnpm sync:design-system`).
- Product rail active state uses Ink, not blue. Blue is for selection/platform action only.
- Run `pnpm sync:design-system` after updating icons or logos in the design system folder.
